{
  "_comment": [
    "Deterministic gate rules read by .claude/herald/scripts/validate_content.py. Unknown keys such as this one are ignored.",
    "init replaces each quoted numeric placeholder (MIN_CHARS, MAX_CHARS, CATEGORY_MIN_CHARS, CATEGORY_MAX_CHARS), quotes included, with a number (or null for no maximum), so the file stays valid JSON.",
    "frontmatter.required: replace with the repo's required frontmatter keys. length.count: nonspace | all. per_category: one entry per category with overrides, or {}.",
    "forbidden: one object per phrase; status draft only warns, confirmed fails the gate. Rules extracted from existing articles start as draft (INV6); only a human sets confirmed. Remove the placeholder entry if there are none.",
    "images.public_dir: directory that maps to the site root, so /images/x.png resolves to <public_dir>/images/x.png.",
    "prose: readability hints, warnings only (never fail the gate). Optional keys: check, max_sentence (chars for ko/ja/zh, words otherwise; >= 1), max_numbers (>= 1, default 5), max_asides (>= 1, default 2), repeat_label (>= 2, default 3), stock_phrases (extra phrases to flag). A value out of range falls back to its default."
  ],
  "frontmatter": {
    "required": ["title", "description", "slug", "date"]
  },
  "length": {
    "min_chars": "{{MIN_CHARS}}",
    "max_chars": "{{MAX_CHARS}}",
    "count": "nonspace",
    "per_category": {
      "{{CATEGORY_NAME}}": {
        "min_chars": "{{CATEGORY_MIN_CHARS}}",
        "max_chars": "{{CATEGORY_MAX_CHARS}}"
      }
    }
  },
  "forbidden": [
    {
      "pattern": "{{FORBIDDEN_PATTERN}}",
      "regex": false,
      "status": "draft",
      "note": "{{FORBIDDEN_NOTE}}"
    }
  ],
  "links": {
    "check": true
  },
  "images": {
    "check": true,
    "public_dir": "{{PUBLIC_DIR}}"
  },
  "prose": {
    "check": true,
    "stock_phrases": []
  }
}
